WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
A match is only a yes.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.350
Reaching a real meeting still needs
people, timing, a place,

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.600
and a shared plan.

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:11.500
MyScoutee starts with your private,
editable priority list.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.250
Your choices are a signal,
not the final answer.

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:18.650
Everyone arranges their own list
independently.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.000
Profile fit, context, distance, and mutual
interest help shape what comes next.

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:26.800
Together, those signals can form
balanced groups,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.700
so more people get a real chance
to meet.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:34.500
The group stays full
when plans change,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.400
while everyone organizes people,
transport, place, and supplies.

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:41.300
Then the plan becomes
a real meeting.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.600
Profiles gain voices.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.150
Shared experience creates context.
Private priorities stay private.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.800
You do not have to meet everyone

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.000
to reach the right person.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.050
MyScoutee is designed
for the meeting.
